{"id":"5049","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5049_main_cumulus-congestus-and-altocumulus-cumulogenitus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图像显示出强烈发芽的积云，具有清晰的轮廓和合理的垂直范围。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阳光照射的部分是明亮的白色</span>，而它们的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">底部相对较暗并且几乎是水平的</span>。凸出的上部<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">类似于花椰菜</span>，这是浓云云种的特征，并且还没有变得模糊不清。在照片左侧正在发展的细胞后面，随着积云在垂直发展过程中到达稳定层，云已<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">扩散形成积云性高积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Nikki Miguel","location":"南非比勒陀利亚","latitude":"纬度: 25° 45' 17'' S","longitude":"经度: 28° 14' 22'' E","date":"13 January 2016 1754 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 6, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.3"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5049_syn_cumulus-congestus-and-altocumulus-cumulogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>1200 UTC表面压力图显示了中心位于南非内陆一直到比勒陀利亚西南部的1002 hPa低压。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 2016 南非气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/radar/5049_radar_cumulus-congestus-and-altocumulus-cumulogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>拍摄照片时的雷达图像显示拍摄照片的地区有几阵阵雨。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 2016 南非气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5049_sat_cumulus-congestus-and-altocumulus-cumulogenitus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在照片前一段时间拍摄的红外卫星图像显示了与南非东北部阵雨相关的明亮白色（冷）云顶的散射。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2016","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4766_main_cumulus-congestus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>积云通常是密集的，具有清晰轮廓，以上升的山丘、圆顶或塔等的形式垂直发展。积云通常是分离的云；虽然无法确定这张图像中的这些云是否分离，但是在海岸外的海面上的阴影表明主要细胞有一定程度的分离。它们还有非常<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">明亮的白色阳光照射部分</span>；相对<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">较暗且近水平的云底</span>；与积云有关的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">强垂直范围</span>。值得注意的是，强烈的萌芽、清晰的轮廓和凸起的上部，类似于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>的花椰菜，决定了其为浓云云种。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alfons Puertas","location":"西班牙巴塞罗那Vallvidrera","latitude":"纬度: 41° 25' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 7' 27'' E","date":"15 September 2015 1406 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.3"}]}]}